{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast, frantic, and stylish</strong>, <i>Blitzstrike\u00a0</i>blends tight 2D gunplay with cinematic moments, hidden paths, and an explosive climax. It\u2019s a short, sweet, sharp blast of arcade action designed to be beaten in under an hour\u2014but packed with enough secrets and style to keep speedrunners and explorers coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654000/extras/BSLogo.png?t=1750986639\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Blitzstrike</strong>, you are Trixel \u2014 a pink-haired, trigger-happy bounty hunter with a sharp tongue, sharper reflexes, and zero patience for standing still. When a mysterious threat resurfaces, Trixel is thrust into a high-speed, high-stakes mission across a green-lit neon city, a sky-high bridge, and rooftops that barely hold beneath her boots. Along the way, she faces off against deadly bots, tight spaces, and a vicious threat who might just be her deadliest rival\u2014or her only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654000/extras/Trixel.png?t=1750986639\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654000/extras/Vectoria.png?t=1750986639\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nice to Meetcha!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654000/148658f24457045c8e86073b26d68c9b5ef86703.jpg"},{"name":"Bienvenue \u00e0 Le Vert","path":"https://cdn.a